---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { posts, date, minutes } from '../lib/posts';
const all=await posts();const featured=all[0];const categories=[...new Set(all.map(p=>p.data.category))];
---
<Base><section class="hero wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> UNIVERSE'S ENGINEERING NOTES</p><h1>만드는 과정에,<br/><span>배움이 남는다.</span></h1><p class="intro">코드 너머의 생각부터 서비스가 동작하는 순간까지.<br/>직접 만들고 검증하며 쌓아가는 작은 기술 우주.</p><a class="text-link" href="#writing">기록 살펴보기 <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="orbit-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit o1"></div><div class="orbit o2"></div><div class="orbit o3"></div><span class="planet"></span><span class="satellite"></span><span class="cross">+</span><span class="orbit-label">BUILD · LEARN · DOCUMENT</span><span class="coordinate">FIELD NOTES / 001</span></div></section>
<section class="wrap featured"><div class="section-caption"><span>01 / FEATURED NOTE</span><span>시작하는 기록</span></div>{featured&&<a class="featured-card" href={'/posts/'+featured.id+'/'}><div class="feature-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="terminal-label">~/dev-universe</span><div class="terminal-lines"><span><b>→</b> make something</span><span><b>→</b> understand why</span><span><b>→</b> write it down<span class="cursor">_</span></span></div><span class="art-bottom">FROM IDEA TO SOMETHING REAL</span></div><div class="feature-copy"><span class="tag">{featured.data.category}</span><h2>{featured.data.title}</h2><p>{featured.data.description}</p><div class="meta">{date(featured.data.date)}<span>·</span>{minutes(featured.body)}분 읽기 <span class="arrow">↗</span></div></div></a>}</section>
<section id="writing" class="wrap writing"><div class="writing-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE ARCHIVE</p><h2>기술 기록<span class="count">{all.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</span></h2></div><label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="글 제목, 내용, 태그 검색" aria-label="글 검색"/></label></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="주제 필터"><button class="active" data-category="all" aria-pressed="true">전체</button>{categories.map(c=><button data-category={c} aria-pressed="false">{c}</button>)}</div><div class="post-list">{all.map((p,i)=><article class="post-row" data-category={p.data.category} data-search={[p.data.title,p.data.description,...p.data.tags,p.body].join(' ').toLowerCase()}><span class="index">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><div class="meta"><span class="category">{p.data.category}</span><span>{date(p.data.date)}</span></div><h3><a href={'/posts/'+p.id+'/'}>{p.data.title}</a></h3><p>{p.data.description}</p><div class="tags">{p.data.tags.map(t=><span>#{t}</span>)}</div></div><span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>)}</div><p id="empty" hidden role="status">일치하는 글이 없습니다. 다른 검색어나 주제를 선택해 보세요.</p><p id="results" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
<section class="wrap closing"><span class="mark">✳</span><div><h2>완성된 답보다, 풀어가는 과정.</h2><p>이곳은 universe가 만들고 배우는 것들의 작업 노트입니다.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/about/">블로그 소개 ↗</a></section>
<script>let selected='all';const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#search')!;const rows=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.post-row')];function filter(){let n=0;for(const row of rows){const show=(selected==='all'||row.dataset.category===selected)&&(row.dataset.search||'').includes(input.value.trim().toLowerCase());row.hidden=!show;if(show)n++}document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#empty')!.hidden=n!==0;document.querySelector('#results')!.textContent=n+'개의 글';}input.addEventListener('input',filter);document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-category].filters button, .filters button').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{selected=b.dataset.category!;document.querySelectorAll('.filters button').forEach(x=>{x.classList.toggle('active',x===b);x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b))});filter()}));</script></Base>
